 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Rendering",
  "excerpt": "The goal of this repository is to formalize standard results about the Mandelbrot set in Lean. The main result is that [the Mandelbrot set and its complement are connected](http://github.com/girving/ray/blob/main/Ray/Dynamics/Mandelbrot.lean#L37), by exhibiting the analytic Böttcher homeomorphism from the exterior of the Mandelbrot set to the exterior of the closed unit disk. But I'm also using it to learn Lean generally, which means detours along the way."
 },
